Sprott, J. C., &amp; Chlouverakis, K. E. (2007). Labyrinth chaos. International Journal of Bifurcation and Chaos, 17(06), 2097-2108. https://doi.org/10.1142/S0218127407018245&#160;&#x21a9;&#xfe0e;
