ewtheorem*{theorem*}{Theorem}  egin{document}  egin{theorem*} Let $f$ and $g$ be continuous functions on a metric space $X$. Then $f + g$, $fg$, and $f/g$ are continuous on $X$. \end{theorem*} \end{document} 
